Trademarks
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is an independent, community-maintained client library. It is not
affiliated with, endorsed or sponsored by Graylog, Inc.
Graylog and Graylog Open are trademarks of Graylog, Inc. All other product names, logos and
brands are the property of their respective owners and are used for
identification purposes only.

The Graylog Open server itself is licensed separately by its owner:
SSPL-1.0 (source-available).
This SDK contains no Graylog Open server code; it talks to the service over its
public network interfaces only: the documented REST API, the public GELF 1.1
wire format (UDP, TCP, HTTP) and the standard OTLP/gRPC logs protocol. The
Docker test fixture runs the unmodified upstream images (graylog/graylog,
OpenSearch, MongoDB); they are not part of the distributed packages.

